#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"GDAL, a required library, provides functionality needed for raster support "
"<command>gdal-config</command> to enable software installations to locate "
"the GDAL installation directory. Use this parameter (<command>--with-"
"gdalconfig=/path/to/gdal-config</command>) to manually specify a particular "
"GDAL installation that PostGIS will build against."
msgstr ""
"GDAL, ett nödvändigt bibliotek, tillhandahåller funktioner som behövs för "
"rasterstöd. Med <command>gdal-config</command> kan programvaruinstallationer"
" hitta GDAL-installationskatalogen. Använd parametern (<command>--with-"
"gdalconfig=/path/to/gdal-config</command>) för att manuellt ange en viss "
"GDAL-installation som PostGIS ska byggas mot."

#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These are the control files that denote information such as the version of "
"the extension to install if not specified. <filename>postgis.control, "
"postgis_topology.control</filename>."
msgstr ""
"Det här är kontrollfilerna som anger information, exempelvis vilken version "
"av tillägget som ska installeras om ingen version anges: "
"<filename>postgis.control, postgis_topology.control</filename>."

#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have the extension installed in the database you are querying, you'll"
" see mention in the <varname>installed_version</varname> column. If you get "
"no records back, it means you don't have postgis extensions installed on the"
" server at all. PgAdmin III 1.14+ will also provide this information in the "
"<varname>extensions</varname> section of the database browser tree and will "
"even allow upgrade or uninstall by right-clicking."
msgstr ""
"Om du har tillägget installerat i den databas du frågar kommer det att visas"
" i kolumnen <varname>installed_version</varname>. Om du inte får några "
"poster tillbaka betyder det att inga PostGIS-tillägg alls är installerade på"
" servern. PgAdmin III 1.14+ visar också denna information i avsnittet "
"<varname>extensions</varname> i databasbläddrarens träd och kan till och med"
" uppgradera eller avinstallera genom högerklickning."

#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Currently, the <command>make check</command> relies on the <code>PATH</code>"
" and <code>PGPORT</code> environment variables when performing the checks - "
"it does <emphasis>not</emphasis> use the PostgreSQL version that may have "
"been specified using the configuration parameter <command>--with-"
"pgconfig</command>. So make sure to modify your PATH to match the detected "
"PostgreSQL installation during configuration or be prepared to deal with the"
" impending headaches."
msgstr ""
"För närvarande förlitar sig <command>make check</command> på "
"miljövariablerna <code>PATH</code> och <code>PGPORT</code> när kontrollerna "
"utförs. Det använder <emphasis>inte</emphasis> PostgreSQL-versionen som kan "
"ha angetts med konfigurationsparametern <command>--with-pgconfig</command>. "
"Se därför till att ändra PATH så att den matchar PostgreSQL-installationen "
"som identifieras under konfigurationen, annars kan du få problem senare."

#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you previously ran the <command>make comments</command> command to "
"generate the <filename>postgis_comments.sql</filename>, "
"<filename>raster_comments.sql</filename> file, install the sql file by "
"running"
msgstr ""
"Om du tidigare körde kommandot <command>make comments</command> för att "
"generera filerna <filename>postgis_comments.sql</filename> och "
"<filename>raster_comments.sql</filename>, installerar du SQL-filen genom att"
" köra"

#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The output from configure is used to generate the "
"<filename>postgis_config.h</filename> file. Check that the "
"<varname>POSTGIS_PGSQL_VERSION</varname>, "
"<varname>POSTGIS_PROJ_VERSION</varname> and "
"<varname>POSTGIS_GEOS_VERSION</varname> variables have been set correctly."
msgstr ""
"Utdata från configure används för att generera filen "
"<filename>postgis_config.h</filename>. Kontrollera att variablerna "
"<varname>POSTGIS_PGSQL_VERSION</varname>, "
"<varname>POSTGIS_PROJ_VERSION</varname> och "
"<varname>POSTGIS_GEOS_VERSION</varname> har ställts in korrekt."
